    "long_instructions": "## Fitness Tracker\r\n\r\nCreate a program that calculates the calories burned during a workout. Choose the activities, how long each activity lasts, and how many calories each burns per minute.\r\n\r\n### Build Your Program\r\n\r\nYour program must:\r\n\r\n* Store workout information in variables and a numeric list\r\n* Access at least two list elements and use them in expressions\r\n* Calculate the total calories burned\r\n* Build and print a message that includes the result\r\n\r\nRun your program and fix any errors. Then ask AI Tutor to review it against the requirements and make any final changes yourself.\r\n\r\n::: details [Need help? Ask AI Tutor]\r\n\r\nYou can ask AI Tutor to help you:\r\n\r\n* Decide what workout information to store\r\n* Plan how to calculate the calories burned\r\n* Check whether your plan meets the requirements\r\n* Give you a hint about a specific part of your code\r\n* Explain an error message\r\n\r\nAsk for guidance or hints, but write the program yourself.\r\n\r\n:::",
